   \[
   f(x) = \sqrt{6} \left( \sqrt[4}{\frac{1}{6}} \right)^x
   \]

   Alternatively, this can be written as:
   \[
   f(x) = \sqrt{6} \left( \frac{1}{6^{1/4}} \right)^x
   \]

