   Thus, the negation can be written as:  
   \[
   (A \cup B \cap A = A) \cdot \overline{A \cap B} \cup \overline{B}
   \]  

Thus, the negation of the proposition is:  
\[
\boxed{(A \cup B \cap A = A) \cdot \overline{A \cap B} \cup \overline{B}}
\]
