6. **Convert the area from ft² to m²:**  
   - \(400 \, \text{ft}^2 = 400 \times 0.0361 \, \text{m}^2 = 28.44 \, \text{m}^2\).  

7. **Calculate the total power required:**  
   \[
   P = \frac{45 \times 3}{3600} \times 28.44 = 2.1 \, \text{hp}
   \]",relevance,"# Task Description
