1. **Oxidation at the anode (Pb electrode):**
  \[ \text{Pb(s)} + \text{H}_2\text{SO}_4(\text{aq}) \rightarrow \text{PbSO}_4(\text{s}) + \text{H}^+(\text{aq}) \]
2. **Reduction at the cathode (Pb}_2\text{O}_3/\text{Pb}_2\text{O}_4 \text{ electrode):**
